  "date": "2015-08",
  "title": "Invitation To The 2015 Swiss Venture Competition Finals",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Swiss Venture Competition Finals 2015",
      "text": "Some of the most dynamic start-ups in the Climate-KIC Accelerator will take to the stage followed by an inspiring keynote by Professor Andreas Fischlin, head of the Terrestrial Systems Ecology Group and co-author of several IPCC Reports (Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change).\n\nOn Wednesday, 19 August 2015 Climate-KIC Switzerland invites you to its fourth annual Swiss Venture Competition finals at ETH Zurich (AudiMax, HG F 30, 5.15 p.m.).\n\nThe two winners will be then selected by the expert panel and awarded prizes of CHF 20’000 each, as well as a place in the European Climate-KIC Venture Competition finals in Birmingham (UK) in October. The evening will be rounded off with networking drinks and climate-friendly snacks giving you the chance to meet the start-ups and other members of the Climate-KIC Swiss community."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Swiss Venture Competition Finals 2015",
      "text": "Date Wednesday, 19 August 2015 17:15 to 21:00 CET\n\nLocation ETH Zurich Auditorium Maximum (HG F 30) Rämistrasse 101 8092 Zurich Switzerland\n\nTo secure your seats register online by Wednesday, 12 August 2015."
    }
  ],
